c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEdTJtb4OQH1asjHW3RxGz5FDRp7FaWU6FaScvkXf9b2A&oe=6A845298"}, {"file_name": "frame_00011.png", "id": "1866781784024533", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1866781787357866_1449258122349170307_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jdQPFBK7X2IQ7kNvwGmfqhW&_nc_oc=AdrlU-Vneb8Clqth-6_coP-9V08BrtaK3GhiZqYxfcONUHCrdiBh7gQJ6njp_QY2XTI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-OjKwAoVrLRiasWxmboAWjWCJ9OOrPh-yGZ_Ed8AY-Q&oe=6A845EFD"}, {"file_name": "frame_00004.png", "id": "955995223767947", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_955995227101280_1539550393778462483_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UdU0L7P3jLUQ7kNvwFY916w&_nc_oc=Adojd2HZbqSX2m6FxbqHX-Jo1g8ua0NdcmaRcPyRRT3EaLtIEqPw-0c2U7DNkS7hkbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEx_tcy0A6qB3gCeOTvwZrcTmHfCSr75hUb34TCI8OScg&oe=6A845BE3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "491821674_891128597084563_561137717506253286_n (1).png", "id": "26537612979210846", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_26537612982544179_4106358523309899352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OhYJxs_KDdMQ7kNvwFibHsw&_nc_oc=AdpFFZ65_eXpn1A8ISTDdQVEHyP4_OYqGsuK8irKXtSmmXd6SMMw1-CTXNdAPND9XRc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG8BCx3G8pLePYWxt-YbiFU5vVFq-AUDnyB_6PaBcOZeg&oe=6A844074"}, "display_name": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "social", "horror", "casual"], "long_description": "**Rusty Robots: The Harvest** (or simply **Harvest**) takes place in the distant future. Play with your friends across **MANY free-play maps**, with optional **20-player lobbies** for even more players!\n\nExplore maps such as:\n\n* The Bedroom\n* The Robo Gallery\n* The Maze\n* The Arcade\n* The Forest\n* The Robo Shop\n* OG\n* And more!\n\nThere are also several gamemodes and minigames to play, including:\n\n* **Bomb Tag:** A competitive hot-potato style tag game taking place in the Forest. Pass the bomb to other players before it's too late!\n* **Snowball PVP:** Battle the opposing teams using snowball cannons! Fight across three bases, Red, Green, and Blue, with a central island in the middle.\n* **Slender Horror:** Play the Slender-themed minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Pacman:** Play the Pacman minigame in the Arcade.\n* **Fireball Survival:** Dodge fireballs and try to survive as long as possible.\n\nFree-play takes place inside a simulation run by **Robo-Labs**, a sort of playground for testing the 4 Robo-Labs Robo Models, including the **All-New Robo V4!**\n\nCustomize your \"Unit\" with a **surplus of cosmetics** available in the Robo Shop, including hats, masks, skins, holdables, and more. Players start with **800 currency** and receive **150 currency every day they log in**.\n\nHarvest uses a **semi-realistic graphics style** to bring the Robo-Labs simulation to life.\n\n**UGC is planned through mod.io**, with plans to let players create and share their own **maps** in the future.\n\nTrailer by **@JacobTheYeepsDude** on YouTube.", "short_description": "Rusty Robots: The Harvest, or Harvest for short, takes place in the distant future. Play with your friends in MANY free-play maps, with optional 20-player lobbies and MANY cosmetics to spice up your look! Play competitive gamemodes like Bomb Tag and Snowball PVP, or try the Arcade's Slender Horror, Pacman, and Fireball Survival minigames. UGC maps are planned through mod.io! ALSO WE HAVE THE BACKROOMS!!\n\nTrailer by @JacobTheYeepsDude on YouTube"}]}, "developer_name": "Nicktender", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rustedgames/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rusted Games", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rustedgames/forms", "website_url": "https